# Our Story API: VS Code "REST Client" / IntelliJ HTTP Client file.
# Run the backend with the dev profile first: mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.profiles=dev
#
# CSRF: every POST/PUT/DELETE needs the header X-XSRF-TOKEN equal to the XSRF-TOKEN cookie.
#  1. Send "question" below (any GET sets the cookie; the client keeps its cookie jar automatically).
#  2. Copy the cookie value into @xsrf (REST Client: see the response's Set-Cookie header).
# The answer below is a DUMMY. Never commit a real answer; change @answer locally and do not commit that edit.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@xsrf = PASTE-XSRF-TOKEN-COOKIE-VALUE
@answer = Sample
@worldSlug = where-it-all-began

### ---------------- Viewer flow ----------------

### 1. Lock screen question (also issues the XSRF-TOKEN cookie)
# @name question
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/question

### 2. Am I unlocked?
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/status

### 3. Unlock (204 + Set-Cookie os_viewer). Without X-XSRF-TOKEN this is 403.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/unlock
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{ "answer": "{{answer}}" }

### 4. Everything the home screen needs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/experience

### 5. One world (open: full content; locked: teaser; unknown or unpublished: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/{{worldSlug}}

### 6. Locked world teaser (before 2027-02-14T00:00:00+05:30)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/our-forever

### 7. Unknown world -> 404 problem+json
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/worlds/nope

### 8. A photo (replace the id with a mediaId from the experience/world response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/media/01K6G2V8Q3N7X4B2C9D5E1WA01/thumb

### 9. Lock again (clears the cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/lock
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### ---------------- Admin flow (needs the Google admin session) ----------------
# Sign in once in the browser: {{baseUrl}}/oauth2/authorization/google, then copy the JSESSIONID cookie into
# the header below (or use the REST Client cookie jar after browsing). All mutating calls need X-XSRF-TOKEN.

@adminCookie = JSESSIONID=PASTE-SESSION-ID

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/me
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Start a Google Photos Picker session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/picker/sessions
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "maxItemCount": 50 }

### Poll the picker session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/picker/sessions/PASTE-SESSION-ID
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Start the import (202 {jobId})
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/picker/sessions/PASTE-SESSION-ID/import
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### Import progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/imports/PASTE-JOB-ID
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Imported media
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/media?page=0&size=50
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Delete a media item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/media/PASTE-MEDIA-ID
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### List worlds (all, including unpublished)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Create a world
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "road-trips",
  "title": "Road Trips",
  "subtitle": "Windows down",
  "tagline": "Are we there yet?",
  "layout": "POSTCARDS",
  "themeAccent": "#b76e79",
  "unlockAt": null,
  "introText": "Intro",
  "outroText": "Outro",
  "published": false
}

### Update a world. Omitted "published" and "unlockAt" KEEP the stored values; "unlockAt": null CLEARS it
# (add "unlockAt": null below to make the world always open).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds/PASTE-WORLD-ID
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slug": "road-trips", "title": "Road Trips", "layout": "POSTCARDS", "published": true }

### Delete a world: needs ?confirm=true (without it: 400 + moment count). Moments go, letters are kept.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds/PASTE-WORLD-ID?confirm=true
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### Reorder worlds (every id exactly once)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds/reorder
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderedIds": ["PASTE-ID-1", "PASTE-ID-2"] }

### Moments of a world
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds/PASTE-WORLD-ID/moments
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Replace the moments (array order is display order)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/worlds/PASTE-WORLD-ID/moments
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "moments": [ { "mediaId": "PASTE-MEDIA-ID", "caption": "First coffee", "note": "back of the polaroid", "happenedOn": "2019-03-02", "place": "Pune", "favourite": true } ] }

### Letters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/letters
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Create a letter (body is raw markdown)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/letters
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "worldId": "PASTE-WORLD-ID", "title": "For you", "body": "# Hello\n\nI **love** you.", "revealTrigger": "WORLD_OUTRO" }

### Update / delete a letter
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/letters/PASTE-LETTER-ID
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "worldId": "PASTE-WORLD-ID", "title": "For you", "body": "Edited", "revealTrigger": "SEALED_ICON" }

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/letters/PASTE-LETTER-ID
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### Settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settings
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Update settings (partial; unlockAnswers is write-only and signs every viewer out)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settings
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tagline": "Love you till eternity and back", "heroMediaIds": ["PASTE-MEDIA-ID"] }
# Unlock answers (write-only, 4+ characters once spaces are ignored; same values again change nothing):
# { "unlockQuestion": "Test question?", "unlockAnswers": ["Sample", "Other Answer"] }

### Unlock lockout recovery: clears per-client and global unlock failure counters (204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/auth/reset-rate-limits
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

### Sign every viewer out
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settings/sign-out-everyone
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
